<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>My soul is night, my heart is steel—</l><l>I cannot see, I cannot feel;</l><l>For light, for life I must appeal</l><l>In simple faith to Jesus.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>He died, He lives, He reigns, He pleads;</l><l>There’s love in all His words and deeds;</l><l>There’s all a guilty sinner needs</l><l>Forevermore in Jesus.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Though some should sneer, and some should blame,</l><l>I’ll go with all my guilt and shame;</l><l>I’ll go to Him because His name,</l><l>Above all names, is Jesus.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
